maia3-5m.onnx

This file is a converted copy of the Maia-3 5M chess model ("Maia3 5M").

Authors: the Computational Social Science Lab (CSSLab), University of Toronto:
  Daniel Monroe, George Eilender, Philip Chalmers, Zhenwei Tang and Ashton Anderson.
  Paper: "Chessformer: A Unified Architecture for Chess Modeling", ICLR 2026,
  https://openreview.net/forum?id=2ltBRzEHyd

Upstream:
  Code:    https://github.com/CSSLab/maia3 (commit 1e13597c42d4858b7cfd7cfdae01e297263364b2)
  Weights: https://huggingface.co/UofTCSSLab/Maia3-5M (revision b6559de2398d7140b985f28fd2c19fb5e47ddabe,
           file maia3-5m.pt, sha256 ba14208b2992d85502f5fb501934abf6aaaeb355e9f3fdf90e326911f562524f)

